                  "oneOfCase": "RRT_V2_BLOCK_ELEMENTS_JSON",
                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Good afternoon. I’d like to send this package to Beijing. The contents are made of glass, so I’m worried that they might break or crack in transit.\\nB: I understand. I’ll put a “Fragile” sticker on it so our staff knows to handle it gently.\\nA: Thanks.\\nB: As for shipping options, here’s a list of what we offer.\\nA: I’m not in a hurry, so I’ll just use the cheapest option.\\nB: Okay. And you can track the status of your package on our Web site. I’ll circle the number you need on your receipt.\"}]]}]]}"
                }
              }
            },
